{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 20,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 348.344,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there was a place in Shemlon",
      "verse": "20:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.409,
      "end": 7.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "where the daughters of the Lamanites did gather themselves together to sing,",
      "verse": "20:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.187,
      "end": 8.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to dance,",
      "verse": "20:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.574,
      "end": 10.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to make themselves merry.",
      "verse": "20:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.019,
      "end": 13.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there was one day",
      "verse": "20:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 13.707,
      "end": 17.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a small number of them gathered together to sing and to dance.",
      "verse": "20:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 18.613,
      "end": 20.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now the priests of king Noah,",
      "verse": "20:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 21.022,
      "end": 24.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being ashamed to return to the city of Nephi,",
      "verse": "20:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 24.453,
      "end": 27.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also fearing that the people would slay them,",
      "verse": "20:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.744,
      "end": 31.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they durst not return to their wives and their children.",
      "verse": "20:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 32.139,
      "end": 34.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And having tarried in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "20:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.641,
      "end": 38.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having discovered the daughters of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "20:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 38.211,
      "end": 40.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they laid and watched them;",
      "verse": "20:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 40.934,
      "end": 45.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when there were but few of them gathered together to dance,",
      "verse": "20:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 45.247,
      "end": 48.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they came forth out of their secret places",
      "verse": "20:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 48.213,
      "end": 51.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took them and carried them into the wilderness;",
      "verse": "20:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 51.876,
      "end": 55.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, twenty and four of the daughters of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "20:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 55.4,
      "end": 57.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they carried into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "20:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 58.402,
      "end": 64.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the Lamanites found that their daughters had been missing,",
      "verse": "20:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 64.341,
      "end": 66.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were angry with the people of Limhi,",
      "verse": "20:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 67.122,
      "end": 69.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they thought it was the people of Limhi.",
      "verse": "20:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 70.356,
      "end": 72.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore they sent their armies forth;",
      "verse": "20:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 72.812,
      "end": 75.784,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even the king himself went before his people;",
      "verse": "20:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 75.964,
      "end": 80.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they went up to the land of Nephi to destroy the people of Limhi.",
      "verse": "20:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 80.87,
      "end": 83.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Limhi had discovered them from the tower,",
      "verse": "20:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 83.929,
      "end": 87.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even all their preparations for war did he discover;",
      "verse": "20:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 87.313,
      "end": 89.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he gathered his people together,",
      "verse": "20:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 90.14,
      "end": 93.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and laid wait for them in the fields and in the forests.",
      "verse": "20:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 94.349,
      "end": 98.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the Lamanites had come up,",
      "verse": "20:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 98.198,
      "end": 102.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the people of Limhi began to fall upon them from their waiting places,",
      "verse": "20:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 103.115,
      "end": 104.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to slay them.",
      "verse": "20:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 105.42,
      "end": 108.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the battle became exceedingly sore,",
      "verse": "20:10",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 109.037,
      "end": 111.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they fought like lions for their prey.",
      "verse": "20:10",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 112.178,
      "end": 117.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people of Limhi began to drive the Lamanites before them;",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 117.884,
      "end": 121.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet they were not half so numerous as the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 121.501,
      "end": 123.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But they fought for their lives,",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 123.678,
      "end": 125.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for their wives,",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 125.53,
      "end": 127.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for their children;",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 127.428,
      "end": 131.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they exerted themselves and like dragons did they fight.",
      "verse": "20:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 132.009,
      "end": 137.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they found the king of the Lamanites among the number of their dead;",
      "verse": "20:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 137.344,
      "end": 138.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet he was not dead,",
      "verse": "20:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 139.149,
      "end": 142.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having been wounded and left upon the ground,",
      "verse": "20:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 142.255,
      "end": 144.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so speedy was the flight of his people.",
      "verse": "20:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 145.489,
      "end": 147.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they took him and bound up his wounds,",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 148.037,
      "end": 150.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and brought him before Limhi, and said:",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 150.446,
      "end": 153.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, here is the king of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 153.366,
      "end": 156.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he having received a wound has fallen among their dead",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 157.029,
      "end": 158.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they have left him;",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 158.695,
      "end": 161.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, we have brought him before you;",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 161.615,
      "end": 163.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and now let us slay him.",
      "verse": "20:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 163.874,
      "end": 165.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Limhi said unto them:",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 165.865,
      "end": 167.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye shall not slay him,",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 167.531,
      "end": 169.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but bring him hither that I may see him.",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 170.079,
      "end": 171.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they brought him.",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 171.838,
      "end": 173.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Limhi said unto him:",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 173.783,
      "end": 177.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What cause have ye to come up to war against my people?",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 177.214,
      "end": 181.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my people have not broken the oath that I made unto you;",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 181.666,
      "end": 186.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, why should ye break the oath which ye made unto my people?",
      "verse": "20:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 186.804,
      "end": 188.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now the king said:",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 188.517,
      "end": 190.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have broken the oath",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 190.508,
      "end": 194.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because thy people did carry away the daughters of my people;",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 194.357,
      "end": 196.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, in my anger",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 196.441,
      "end": 199.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I did cause my people to come up to war against thy people.",
      "verse": "20:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 200.558,
      "end": 203.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Limhi had heard nothing concerning this matter;",
      "verse": "20:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 203.849,
      "end": 205.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he said:",
      "verse": "20:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 205.469,
      "end": 207.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will search among my people",
      "verse": "20:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 207.739,
      "end": 210.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whosoever has done this thing shall perish.",
      "verse": "20:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 210.705,
      "end": 214.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore he caused a search to be made among his people.",
      "verse": "20:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 214.729,
      "end": 216.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Gideon had heard these things,",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 217.138,
      "end": 219.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being the king's captain,",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 219.408,
      "end": 221.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he went forth and said unto the king:",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 222.096,
      "end": 225.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I pray thee forbear, and do not search this people,",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 225.341,
      "end": 227.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and lay not this thing to their charge.",
      "verse": "20:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 228.111,
      "end": 230.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For do ye not remember the priests of thy father,",
      "verse": "20:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 231.031,
      "end": 233.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom this people sought to destroy?",
      "verse": "20:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 233.394,
      "end": 235.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And are they not in the wilderness?",
      "verse": "20:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 235.524,
      "end": 240.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And are not they the ones who have stolen the daughters of the Lamanites?",
      "verse": "20:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 241.266,
      "end": 244.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, and tell the king of these things,",
      "verse": "20:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 244.511,
      "end": 248.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may tell his people that they may be pacified towards us;",
      "verse": "20:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 248.638,
      "end": 251.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold they are already preparing to come against us;",
      "verse": "20:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 252.022,
      "end": 254.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold also there are but few of us.",
      "verse": "20:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 255.024,
      "end": 257.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, they come with their numerous hosts;",
      "verse": "20:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 258.083,
      "end": 262.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and except the king doth pacify them towards us we must perish.",
      "verse": "20:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 262.803,
      "end": 265.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For are not the words of Abinadi fulfilled,",
      "verse": "20:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 265.955,
      "end": 268.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he prophesied against us\u2014",
      "verse": "20:21",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 268.364,
      "end": 272.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all this because we would not hearken unto the words of the Lord,",
      "verse": "20:21",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 272.213,
      "end": 274.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and turn from our iniquities?",
      "verse": "20:21",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 274.983,
      "end": 277.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now let us pacify the king,",
      "verse": "20:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 277.206,
      "end": 280.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we fulfil the oath which we have made unto him;",
      "verse": "20:22",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 280.219,
      "end": 283.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it is better that we should be in bondage",
      "verse": "20:22",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 283.325,
      "end": 285.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than that we should lose our lives;",
      "verse": "20:22",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 285.966,
      "end": 289.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, let us put a stop to the shedding of so much blood.",
      "verse": "20:22",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 290.268,
      "end": 294.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Limhi told the king all the things concerning his father,",
      "verse": "20:23",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 294.303,
      "end": 296.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the priests that had fled into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "20:23",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 297.177,
      "end": 300.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and attributed the carrying away of their daughters to them.",
      "verse": "20:23",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 301.34,
      "end": 305.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the king was pacified towards his people;",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 306.118,
      "end": 307.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he said unto them:",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 307.923,
      "end": 310.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Let us go forth to meet my people, without arms;",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 310.936,
      "end": 313.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I swear unto you with an oath",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 313.577,
      "end": 315.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that my people shall not slay thy people.",
      "verse": "20:24",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 316.625,
      "end": 319.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they followed the king,",
      "verse": "20:25",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 319.591,
      "end": 323.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went forth without arms to meet the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "20:25",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 323.208,
      "end": 326.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did meet the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "20:25",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 326.267,
      "end": 330.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the king of the Lamanites did bow himself down before them,",
      "verse": "20:25",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 330.441,
      "end": 333.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did plead in behalf of the people of Limhi.",
      "verse": "20:25",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 334.558,
      "end": 337.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the Lamanites saw the people of Limhi,",
      "verse": "20:26",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 337.571,
      "end": 339.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were without arms,",
      "verse": "20:26",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
